      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Model the intended path\n\n2. Identify the blocking hop or policy\n\n3. Correlate with recent changes\n\n4. Validate the correction with a repeat analysis",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Model the intended path\n\n2. Identify the blocking hop or policy\n\n3. Correlate with recent changes\n\n4. Validate the correction with a repeat analysis",
      "autoResize": true,
